{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/BoundedResponse"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Fetches ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"request"},{"text":", refusing anything larger than ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"limit"},{"text":" or slower than","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deadline"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/BoundedResponse\/data(for:session:limit:deadline:)"},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"data","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"for","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"request","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation10URLRequestV","text":"URLRequest","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"session","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSURLSession","text":"URLSession","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"limit","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deadline","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s8DurationV","text":"Duration","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","text":"Data","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The request to fetch."}]}],"name":"request"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The session to fetch with."}]}],"name":"session"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The maximum accepted body size, in bytes."}]}],"name":"limit"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The longest the whole exchange may take, or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" to rely"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on the session’s own timeouts alone."}]}],"name":"deadline"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Return Value","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"return-value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The response body, never larger than "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"limit"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Three guards, in the order that spends the least on a bad response:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A non-2xx status throws "},{"code":"URLError.badServerResponse","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", with the status"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in its description, "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"before the body is read at all","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — an error"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"page is not a config, however well it decodes."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A declared "},{"code":"Content-Length","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" above the cap throws"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"URLError.dataLengthExceedsMaximum","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" immediately, without transferring"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the body."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Otherwise bytes accumulate and the transfer is abandoned as soon as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the count exceeds "},{"code":"limit","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", so the process never holds more than the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cap plus one chunk."}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The deadline covers the whole exchange, headers and body together."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLRequest.timeoutInterval"},{"type":"text","text":" can’t do that job: it is an "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"idle"}]},{"type":"text","text":" timeout,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reset by every packet, so a response that trickles in a byte at a time"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"never trips it, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLSession.shared"},{"type":"text","text":" allows a transfer seven days."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"When the deadline passes, the transfer is cancelled and the call throws"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLError.timedOut"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"code":"URLSession.bytes(for:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" yields one byte at a time — it is the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"only public streaming read, and its buffering keeps that cheaper than"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it looks (roughly 100 ms to reach a 1 MB cap, nearly all of it inside"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the transfer). It is "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" free, which is the other half of why the cap"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is checked against a declared "},{"code":"Content-Length","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" first: a well-behaved"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"oversized response costs one round trip and no iteration at all."}]}],"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Note"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLError.badServerResponse"},{"text":" for a non-2xx status,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLError.dataLengthExceedsMaximum"},{"text":" past the cap, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLError.timedOut"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"past the deadline, and whatever the transport throws.","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Throws"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swidux\/boundedresponse\/data(for:session:limit:deadline:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:6Swidux15BoundedResponseO4data3for7session5limit8deadline10Foundation4DataVAI10URLRequestV_So12NSURLSessionCSis8DurationVSgtYaKFZ","title":"data(for:session:limit:deadline:)","modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}],"symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"data","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"for","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation10URLRequestV","text":"URLRequest","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"session","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSURLSession","text":"URLSession","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"limit","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdent